 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  | (non_pushable((b)::bigint) <= 500)  |        56 |         1 | Index Only Scan          | i_r_b      |   9 |   1
 (pk <= 500) | ((pk % 100) <= 33) | (non_pushable((pk)::bigint) <= 500) |        56 |         1 | Index Scan               | r_pkey     |   3 |   1
 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  | (non_pushable((b)::bigint) <= 500)  |        56 |         3 | Index Scan               | i_r_b      |   6 |   1
 (pk <= 500) | ((pk % 100) <= 33) |                                     |       167 |         1 | Bitmap Index Scan        | r_pkey     |  11 |   1
