 (pk <= 500) | ((pk % 100) <= 33) |                                     |       167 |         2 | Index Scan               | r_pkey     |   2 |   1
 (pk <= 500) | ((pk % 100) <= 33) |                                     |       167 |         4 | Bitmap Index Scan        | r_pkey     |  14 |   1
