 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  |                                     |       167 |         6 | Bitmap Index Scan        | i_r_b      |  18 |   1
 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  |                                     |       167 |         6 | Bitmap Index Scan        | i_r_b      |  20 |   1
 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  |                                     |       167 |         6 | Bitmap Index Scan        | i_r_b      |  21 |   1
 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  |                                     |       167 |        10 | Bitmap Index Scan        | i_r_b      |  11 |   2
 (b <= 500)  | ((b % 100) <= 33)  |                                     |       167 |        10 | Bitmap Index Scan        | i_r_b      |  12 |   2
